    "title": "Road Construction Simulator 3D",
    "description": "Welcome to Road Construction Simulator 3D!\r\n\r\nDrive trucks and operate excavators to building sites with heavy machinery in construction games. Engage in virtual construction tasks across 3D environments.\r\n\r\nOperate cranes, construction vehicles, and forklifts with intuitive controls and detailed physics in excavator games. Complete missions to unlock new vehicles as you progress in forklift driving games.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features of Road Construction Simulator 3D Games:</b>\r\n\r\n- Wide range of heavy machinery\r\n- Multiple modes and level selections\r\n- Detailed controls and physics\r\n- Unlock construction vehicles and levels as you progress\r\n\r\nExperience building sites and tackle construction challenges in forklift excavator games!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Road Construction Simulator 3D!<br><br>Drive trucks and operate excavators to building sites with heavy machinery in construction games. Engage in virtual construction tasks across 3D environments.<br><br>Operate cranes, construction vehicles, and forklifts with intuitive controls and detailed physics in excavator games. Complete missions to unlock new vehicles as you progress in forklift driving games.<br><br><b>Key Features of Road Construction Simulator 3D Games:</b><br><br>- Wide range of heavy machinery<br>- Multiple modes and level selections<br>- Detailed controls and physics<br>- Unlock construction vehicles and levels as you progress<br><br>Experience building sites and tackle construction challenges in forklift excavator games!",
